 "nl": [
  "Permit any TCP port from engineering to student-lab but deny SMB (TCP 445).",
  "edge-cache must never reach cameras, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach dns-servers over RDP (TCP 3389) and LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach cameras over NTP (UDP 123) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Hosts in backup may reach dns-servers over LDAP (TCP 389) and NTP (UDP 123) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Apart from guest-wifi on syslog (UDP 514); partners on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in hr must be dropped.",
  "Deny all traffic from cameras to engineering (this overrides any public service).",
  "engineering must never reach guest-wifi, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Deny all traffic from cameras to student-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "Permit any UDP port from dns-servers to backup but deny SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach edge-cache over RDP (TCP 3389) and HTTP (TCP 80) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Permit any TCP port from guest-wifi to dns-servers but deny SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) and HTTPS (TCP 443) on guest-wifi reachable from all internal zones.",
  "engineering must never reach edge-cache, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Restrict cameras so that its only permitted destinations are partners on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "hr offers HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone."
 ],
